</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>see <ref refid="namespace_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_hoop_1af20b0c13c95457f292bcb44483384b75" kindref="member">checkStretchIncrement()</ref>. </para>
