          <declname>dTau33_dDeltaF</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>dTau33_dDeltaF33</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_stiffness_of_node" kindref="compound">StiffnessOfNode</ref>&lt; 2, nDofPerNode &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>ofNode</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Add the hoop terms of the displacement rows to the stiffness of node <formula id="33">$ A $</formula> (see <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_stiffness_of_node" kindref="compound">StiffnessOfNode</ref>; the displacement comes first among the dofs of a node): the hoop row through the in-plane gradient and through the radial displacement increment, and every displacement row through the hoop stretch in the stress,. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="61">\[  \frac{\partial r^U_{Ar}}{\partial (\partial \Delta u_k / \partial Y_l)} \mathrel{+}= c\,
  \frac{\partial \tau_{\theta\theta}}{\partial \Delta F_{kl}}, \qquad
  \frac{\partial r^U_{Ar}}{\partial \Delta u_r} \mathrel{+}= \frac{c}{\bar r} \Big( \frac{\partial
  \tau_{\theta\theta}}{\partial \Delta F_{\theta\theta}} - \frac{\tau_{\theta\theta}}{\Delta F_{\theta\theta}}
  \Big), \qquad
  \frac{\partial r^U_{Aj}}{\partial \Delta u_r} \mathrel{+}= \frac{V_0}{\bar r} \frac{\partial T_A}{\partial
  x_i} \frac{\partial \tau_{ij}}{\partial \Delta F_{\theta\theta}},
\]</formula> with <formula id="62">$ c = T_A V_0 / (\bar r\, \Delta F_{\theta\theta}) $</formula>. <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nDofPerNode</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The number of dofs per node. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">T_A</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The test function of the node at the center. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">dT_A_dx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Its spatial gradient. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">r</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The radius <formula id="15">$ \bar r $</formula> of the center. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">deltaF33</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The increment of the hoop stretch. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">V0</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The undeformed ring volume of the particle. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">tau33</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The hoop Kirchhoff stress. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">dTau_dDeltaF33</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><formula id="63">$ \partial \tau_{ij} / \partial \Delta F_{\theta\theta} $</formula>, in-plane <formula id="64">$ ij $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">dTau33_dDeltaF</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><formula id="65">$ \partial \tau_{\theta\theta} / \partial \Delta F_{kl} $</formula>, in-plane <formula id="66">$ kl $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">dTau33_dDeltaF33</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><formula id="67">$ \partial \tau_{\theta\theta} / \partial \Delta F_{\theta\theta} $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">ofNode</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The stiffness of the node; the hoop terms are added. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
