          <declname>dN_B_dY</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The derivative of <ref refid="namespace_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_hoop_1a2c3bba2015b259961062d36733b18c00" kindref="member">ringOfFacePoint()</ref> with respect to the radial dof of node <formula id="74">$ B $</formula>, <formula id="75">$ 2\pi \bigl(N_B(\bar{\boldsymbol{Y}}) + \tilde N_{B,j}\,(Y_j - \bar Y_j)\bigr) $</formula>: through the center <formula id="76">$ \bar x_r = \bar r + N_B\,\Delta q_{Br} $</formula> and through  <formula id="77">$ \Delta F_{rj} = \delta_{rj} + \Delta q_{Br}\,
\tilde N_{B,j} $</formula>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">Y</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The point, in the intermediate configuration. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">center</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The particle center <formula id="16">$ \bar{\boldsymbol{Y}} $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
